    <briefdescription>
<para>Fluent builder for creating PopupWindow instances. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Instantiates the <computeroutput>Popup Window</computeroutput> prefab from Resources, attaches it to the <computeroutput>PopupParent</computeroutput> tagged object, and configures it via chained method calls.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cs"><codeline><highlight class="normal">GameObject<sp/>popup<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="class_popup_builder_1a34d13e5b7244a1ccb862e40b3f27609c" kindref="member">PopupBuilder</ref>.Create()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.WithHeader(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;WARNING&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.WithContentText(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Are<sp/>you<sp/>sure?&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.WithFooterButton(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;OK&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>PopupWindow.BUTTON_COLOR_OK,<sp/>OnOK)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.Get();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
